<title>BELGIUM: EU wheat tax enters into force on Thursday.</title>
<headline>EU wheat tax enters into force on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A European Union tax on daily wheat exports will enter into force on Thursday, a European Commission official said.</p>
<p>&quot;It comes into effect on publication in the EU Official Journal tomorrow,&quot; the official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tax, ranging from 10 Ecus a tonne on durum wheat to 20 Ecus a tonne on common wheat flour and semolina, was approved by the European Commission at a weekly meeting in Strasbourg on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Brussels newsroom +322 287 6830</p>
